@TunnelWatch.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5161

### Popis uređaja i vrijeme njihove zadnje poruke
GET {{TunnelWatch.Api_HostAddress}}/api/gateways
Accept: application/json

### Zadnje vrijednosti svih signala uređaja tdce-01
GET {{TunnelWatch.Api_HostAddress}}/api/gateways/tdce-01/latest
Accept: application/json

### Uređaj bez podataka: očekuje se 404 "Nema podataka za uređaj"
GET {{TunnelWatch.Api_HostAddress}}/api/gateways/nepostojeci/latest
Accept: application/json
